# Velaar V2 — Full-Fledged AI-Powered College Infrastructure

Transform Velaar from a teacher-centric tool into an **indispensable, daily-use AI platform** for every stakeholder in an engineering college — teachers, students, admins, HODs, exam controllers, parents, and the registrar.

## What You Already Have (Solid Foundation ✅)

| Role | Features Built |
|------|---------------|
| **Teacher** | Course Generator (PDF syllabus → AI roadmap), Lesson Plan (AI-generated CO-PO mapping, day-wise enrichment), Examination Editor (BT-level question papers, batch .docx export), Question Bank, Attendance (QR-based), Marks Dashboard, Copilot Chat |
| **Student** | Dashboard with exam-taking, AI grading, QR attendance scanner |
| **Admin** | AI usage analytics (cost tracking, token usage, per-teacher breakdown), user approval |
| **HOD** | Department overview, teacher listing, course mapping |
| **Exam Controller** | Basic stats, paper management shell |
| **Parent** | Mocked portal with attendance/CGPA/rank display |
| **Registrar** | Basic dashboard shell |
| **Velaar Admin** | Super-admin institution management |

**Tech Stack**: React 19 + Vite, Firebase (Auth/Firestore), Express.js backend, Google GenAI (`@google/genai`), Recharts, docx export, Tesseract OCR, QR code.

