### 1. 🧠 AI Answer Script Evaluator (Teacher)
**The killer feature.** Teachers upload scanned answer sheets (photos/PDFs), and AI reads handwriting via OCR + vision, grades each answer against the rubric/question paper, assigns CO-wise marks, and pre-fills the marks dashboard.

- Upload scanned answer booklets (bulk PDF or camera capture)
- Velaar AI uses **Gemini Vision** to read handwritten answers
- Auto-grades against the question paper + marking scheme already stored in the system
- Teacher reviews AI suggestions and approves/overrides with one click
- Marks auto-flow into the Marks Dashboard with CO mapping

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This alone saves teachers **20-30 hours per exam cycle**. This is the #1 reason a college would adopt Velaar.

