### Database Schema Additions (Firestore Collections)

```
answer_evaluations/    → Scanned scripts + AI grading results
student_risk_scores/   → Predicted risk scores per student per semester
rubrics/               → Generated marking rubrics per exam
timetables/            → Generated timetables per department
study_materials/       → AI-generated notes per student
lab_manuals/           → Generated lab manuals per course
meeting_minutes/       → MoM records
attainment_data/       → CO attainment calculations
feedback_responses/    → Student feedback submissions
feedback_analysis/     → AI-analyzed feedback results
assignments/           → Assignment definitions + submissions
notices/               → Drafted and published notices
accreditation_reports/ → Generated SAR/AQAR documents
```

