## Recommended Implementation Order

> [!TIP]
> Prioritized by **impact × feasibility**. Features that use data you already have come first.

| Priority | Feature | Why First |
|----------|---------|-----------|
| 🔴 P0 | CO Attainment Calculator (#9) | Uses existing marks + CO data. NBA compliance = instant adoption. |
| 🔴 P0 | Copilot V2 (#3) | Relatively small upgrade, huge perceived value across all roles. |
| 🟠 P1 | Answer Script Evaluator (#1) | Highest wow-factor. Uses Gemini Vision. Saves massive time. |
| 🟠 P1 | Student Risk Predictor (#2) | Uses existing attendance + marks data. Parents love it. |
| 🟠 P1 | Rubric Generator (#4) | Feeds into Answer Evaluator. Quick win. |
| 🟡 P2 | AI Timetable Generator (#5) | High demand but complex constraint solver. |
| 🟡 P2 | Notice Drafter (#10) | Quick win, high daily-use frequency. |
| 🟡 P2 | Study Material Generator (#6) | Students become daily users = platform stickiness. |
| 🟢 P3 | Accreditation Report (#11) | Aggregation feature, needs P0-P2 data first. |
| 🟢 P3 | Feedback Analysis (#12) | Needs feedback collection infrastructure. |
| 🟢 P3 | Lab Manual Generator (#7) | Niche but high-value for lab courses. |
| 🟢 P3 | Assignment Hub (#14) | Requires student submission workflow. |
| 🟢 P3 | Meeting Minutes (#8) | Nice-to-have, lower daily use. |
| 🟢 P3 | Parent Engagement (#13) | Needs risk predictor data (P1) first. |
| 🟢 P3 | Institutional Analytics (#15) | Needs all other features generating data first. |

