## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> **1. Which phase do you want to start with?** I recommend starting with P0 (CO Attainment + Copilot V2) since they build on your existing data and can ship fast.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **2. Gemini Vision for answer evaluation** — are you on a Gemini plan that supports image/vision inputs? The answer evaluator needs multimodal capabilities.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **3. Notification infrastructure** — for parent alerts and student risk notifications, do you want to integrate email (e.g., Resend/SendGrid), WhatsApp (Twilio), or keep it in-app only for now?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **4. Multi-institution support** — should the architecture support multiple colleges on one Velaar instance (SaaS model), or is this for a single institution?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **5. Which features are you most excited about?** Pick your top 3-5 and I'll deep-dive into those first.

